      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOUTHERN STYLE (1) was fast into stride from box four to score two back (22.19) then jumped from the same draw last time but got further back when 6th at this track (24.40). Boasts two wins from three starts out of this box. Tough to beat if on-song. MINTER DELICIOUS (2) hit the ground running off an inside draw last start and was never headed (22.43) at Ballarat in a T3 Grade 6 over 390m. The form from her last run stacks up well. Can measure up again. DOONGALLA MIMIC (7) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (24.18) at this track. Leading chance. RIPPER RAE (8) placed last time (28.40) at this track in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten 1.75 lengths. Has two wins already from this draw.",
